{"seq":2,"slug":"case-pipeline-sla-cost-accounting","title":"打假案件管道 SLA 与成本核算：维权 ROI 度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ipr-counterfeit-graymarket-control/ipr-risk-governance-loop/case-pipeline-sla-cost-accounting","wordCount":2463,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"打假案件管道-sla-与成本核算-维权-roi-度量\">打假案件管道 SLA 与成本核算：维权 ROI 度量</h1><p>一家品牌方一年投了几百万在打假上，年末却答不出一个最基本的问题：<strong>每下架一条侵权链接到底花了多少钱，这些钱换回了多少可量化的收益？</strong> 没有这套账，维权预算永远是被削减的那一项——它看起来只花钱、不产出。本篇把「案件管道」当成一条有明确阶段、明确时限、明确单位成本的<strong>生产流水线</strong>来度量：先用 SLA 约束每个环节的周转时间，再把人力、外采与工具成本落到「单条成功下架」这个单位上，最后用 ROI 模型回答「这笔投入该加还是该砍」。它承接上游的建模与执行——<a href=\"../counterfeit-recognition-determination/infringement-risk-scoring-model\">侵权风险评分模型</a> 决定哪些线索值得进管道，<a href=\"../enforcement-evidence-pipeline/platform-complaint-takedown-workflow\">平台投诉下架与工单 API 化</a> 决定管道怎么把证据投出去；本篇度量的是这条管道的<strong>效率与经济效益</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-案件管道是一条带时限的多阶段链\">核心概念：案件管道是一条带时限的多阶段链</h2><p>侵权案件从线索进入系统到最终闭环，会穿过一系列责任不同、时限不同的阶段。把它们显式建模成阶段链，是能做 SLA 与成本核算的前提——否则「一个案子办了三周」这句话里，你既不知道慢了哪一环，也不知道哪一环在烧钱。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[线索入库 Intake] --&gt; B[分诊定级 Triage]&#10;  B --&gt; C[证据装配 Evidence&lt;br/&gt;哈希固化 + 权属核对]&#10;  C --&gt; D[投递 Submission&lt;br/&gt;平台适配器 / 律师函]&#10;  D --&gt; E[平台处置 Platform&lt;br/&gt;受理 / 驳回]&#10;  E --&gt;|驳回| C&#10;  E --&gt;|受理| F[对方申诉 Appeal]&#10;  F --&gt;|申诉成立| G[反通知再举证]&#10;  G --&gt; E&#10;  F --&gt;|无申诉| H[下架确认 + 复查窗口]&#10;  H --&gt; I[闭环归档 Close]\">flowchart TD\n  A[线索入库 Intake] --&gt; B[分诊定级 Triage]\n  B --&gt; C[证据装配 Evidence&lt;br/&gt;哈希固化 + 权属核对]\n  C --&gt; D[投递 Submission&lt;br/&gt;平台适配器 / 律师函]\n  D --&gt; E[平台处置 Platform&lt;br/&gt;受理 / 驳回]\n  E --&gt;|驳回| C\n  E --&gt;|受理| F[对方申诉 Appeal]\n  F --&gt;|申诉成立| G[反通知再举证]\n  G --&gt; E\n  F --&gt;|无申诉| H[下架确认 + 复查窗口]\n  H --&gt; I[闭环归档 Close]</pre><p>关键工程含义有三点。第一，<strong>每个阶段必须各自打时间戳</strong>，否则端到端 SLA 无法归因到具体环节。第二，<strong>申诉（F）让管道变成有环结构</strong>——一条链接可能在 C→E→F→E 之间来回，因此「案件」与「链接」是两级粒度：一个案件可包含多条链接，度量要分别统计。第三，<strong>每阶段的成本结构不同</strong>：分诊是低成本机器+少量人工，而反通知举证往往是高成本律师介入，成本核算必须按阶段分摊，不能用平均值糊过去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分阶段-sla-与时限预算\">分阶段 SLA 与时限预算</h2><p>SLA 不是给客户看的承诺书，而是<strong>内部节拍器</strong>：它把「尽快处理」翻译成「谁、在多少小时内、必须完成什么」。下表是一套可落地的基线目标（工程目标值，品牌方应按自身团队规模与侵权密度调整）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>计量起点</th>\n<th>SLA 目标</th>\n<th>责任方</th>\n<th>超时动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Intake 入库</td>\n<td>线索产生时刻</td>\n<td>≤ 4h</td>\n<td>采集系统</td>\n<td>告警 + 计入积压看板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Triage 分诊</td>\n<td>入库后</td>\n<td>≤ 8h</td>\n<td>知产专员</td>\n<td>自动降级到低优先级队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Evidence 装配</td>\n<td>分诊完成</td>\n<td>≤ 24h</td>\n<td>证据专员</td>\n<td>阻塞告警，暂缓投递</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Submission 投递</td>\n<td>证据就绪</td>\n<td>≤ 48h</td>\n<td>平台适配器</td>\n<td>升级负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Platform 处置等待</td>\n<td>投递成功</td>\n<td>依平台、外部不可控</td>\n<td>平台</td>\n<td>到期自动催办</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Appeal 申诉应对</td>\n<td>收到申诉</td>\n<td>≤ 72h</td>\n<td>法务</td>\n<td>升级到外部律师</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>要注意<strong>平台处置阶段的时间不受品牌方控制</strong>：欧盟《数字服务法》（Regulation (EU) 2022/2065，即 DSA）第 16 条要求平台对通知「无不迟延」（without undue delay）地确认收悉并作出决定，但具体时长仍由平台裁量。因此度量上应把「品牌方可控时间」（Intake→Submission）与「平台时间」（Submission→Close）<strong>分开统计</strong>，否则平台的拖沓会污染对内部效率的判断。</p>\n<p>端到端 SLA 是最长可控路径的时限之和（环路按单次处理计），可写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>e2e</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>intake</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>triage</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>evidence</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>submit</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{e2e}} = t_{\\text{intake}} + t_{\\text{triage}} + t_{\\text{evidence}} + t_{\\text{submit}} \\le T_{\\text{target}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">e2e</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">intake</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">triage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">evidence</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">submit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>更实用的不是平均耗时，而是 <strong>P90 / P95 分位数</strong>：平均值会被大量秒级驳回的案件拉低，而真正伤业务的是拖到几周的那 5%。工程上应持续上报 <code>p50 / p90 / p95</code> 与<strong>超时率</strong> <code>breach_rate</code>，后者才是 SLA 是否成立的硬指标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位维权成本-把人力-外采与工具拆开\">单位维权成本：把人力、外采与工具拆开</h2><p>「今年花了多少钱」是最没用的问题。有意义的问题是<strong>单条成功下架的单位成本</strong>，它把预算翻译成了可优化、可比价的量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ut</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>劳动</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>外采</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>工具</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>误伤</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>成功下架</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{ut}} = \\frac{C_{\\text{劳动}} + C_{\\text{外采}} + C_{\\text{工具}} + C_{\\text{误伤}}}{N_{\\text{成功下架}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ut</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">成功下架</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">劳动</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">外采</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">工具</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">误伤</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中各项的口径必须明确，否则会重复计价或漏计：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>包含内容</th>\n<th>计量难点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>劳动成本</td>\n<td>知产专员、证据专员、法务的工时 × 全负荷时薪</td>\n<td>需按案件实际工时归集，而非按人月平摊</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外采成本</td>\n<td>外部律所、调查公司、外聘取证、公证</td>\n<td>跨币种需按发生日汇率折算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具成本</td>\n<td>爬虫/监测 SaaS、工单系统、序列化方案摊销</td>\n<td>固定订阅要按期间分摊到当月案件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误伤成本</td>\n<td>错误下架导致的假货认定、平台准确率下降、商誉损失</td>\n<td>最难量化，常以机会成本下限估计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>误伤成本必须显式建模，不能当零。</strong> 平台把「投诉准确率」当作开放高级维权权限的准入门槛——以 Amazon Project Zero 为例，官方门槛为近 6 个月举报受理率 ≥90%、保留权限需准确率 ≥99%（政策详见 Amazon Brand Registry / Project Zero 官方说明）。误伤一条，不只是白花一条的成本，而是<strong>可能拉低整个品牌的权限资格</strong>，其后果是后续所有投诉的边际成本上升。因此分母用「成功下架数」而非「提交数」，分母越大，单位成本越低，而误伤同时抬高分子并压缩未来的分母。</p>\n<p>一个常见的口径陷阱是把<strong>跨环节返工</strong>算进「劳动成本」却不算进「案件数」，导致单位成本被低估。正确做法是：返工工时计入分子，但案件只按最终闭环计一次。</p>\n<h2 id=\"维权-roi-与产出度量\">维权 ROI 与产出度量</h2><p>成本只是分母，ROI 的关键在分子：<strong>维权到底产出了什么</strong>。产出分三类——可回收的直接收益、可避免的损失、以及最重要的威慑带来的增量。前两类能算账，第三类只能建模估计，但<strong>不能因此不算</strong>，否则打假在财务报表上永远是纯成本。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>回收</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>避免</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>威慑</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>总</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>总</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROI = \\frac{V_{\\text{回收}} + V_{\\text{避免}} + \\gamma \\cdot V_{\\text{威慑}} - C_{\\text{总}}}{C_{\\text{总}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">回收</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">避免</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">威慑</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>式中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 是威慑的有效折算系数：下架一条链接，假设对同源假货的后续销售有部分抑制作用，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 就是这部分的可信折扣。<strong>必须把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 单独列出并标注假设来源</strong>，它是整套模型里最容易被夸大的参数——一个把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 设成 0.8 的模型能得出「打假净赚」的结论，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma=0.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span></span></span></span></span> 时结论可能完全反转。</p>\n<p>除 ROI 外，还应配套几个<strong>运营型产出指标</strong>，它们不进入 ROI 公式，但决定管道健康度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>恶劣信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>复发率</td>\n<td>同一货源 30 天内重新上架比例</td>\n<td>高复发 = 只治标未治本，威慑失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>恢复率</td>\n<td>下架链接在复查窗口内复活的比率</td>\n<td>高恢复 = 平台处置不牢，需升级依据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采纳率</td>\n<td>平台受理数 / 提交数</td>\n<td>低采纳 = 证据或依据选错，误伤风险高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阻断价值</td>\n<td>下架链接下架前的估算成交额</td>\n<td>用于校准 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>回收</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{回收}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">回收</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的量级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>复发率尤其值得单独盯：它把「威慑」从一个拍脑袋的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 变成可观测的经验值——<strong>如果同一货源反复出现，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 应调低</strong>，而不是继续按下架条数领功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据管道-如何把度量做成可持续的产出\">数据管道：如何把度量做成可持续的产出</h2><p>SLA 与成本核算如果靠人工月底填 Excel，三个月内必然名存实亡。可持续的做法是把每个阶段的状态变更<strong>作为事件写入事件流</strong>，度量从事件流聚合而来。</p>\n<p>每个案件在状态机转移时发出的事件至少应携带：<code>case_id</code>、<code>link_id</code>、<code>stage</code>、<code>entered_at</code>、<code>actor_role</code>、<code>right_basis</code>、<code>evidence_ref</code>、以及该阶段归集的 <code>labor_minutes</code> 与 <code>external_cost</code>。有了这些字段，SLA 分位数、单位成本与 ROI 都能从同一份事实源派生，而不是各自维护一套口径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[阶段状态变更] --&gt; B[事件写入 event log]&#10;  B --&gt; C[聚合层&lt;br/&gt;按 case / 阶段 / 月份]&#10;  C --&gt; D[SLA 看板&lt;br/&gt;p50/p90/breach]&#10;  C --&gt; E[成本表&lt;br/&gt;单条成本 / 分项]&#10;  C --&gt; F[ROI 模型&lt;br/&gt;含 gamma 敏感性]\">flowchart LR\n  A[阶段状态变更] --&gt; B[事件写入 event log]\n  B --&gt; C[聚合层&lt;br/&gt;按 case / 阶段 / 月份]\n  C --&gt; D[SLA 看板&lt;br/&gt;p50/p90/breach]\n  C --&gt; E[成本表&lt;br/&gt;单条成本 / 分项]\n  C --&gt; F[ROI 模型&lt;br/&gt;含 gamma 敏感性]</pre><p>工程上要守两条纪律。其一，<strong>成本归集必须在事件发生时写入，而非事后补录</strong>——补录的数据一定有系统性遗漏，且无法审计。其二，<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 与汇率、时薪等外生参数必须版本化</strong>：ROI 结论会随假设变化，保留参数版本才能在有人质疑「去年净赚」时复现当时的推导。这也意味着 ROI 报告应始终附带<strong>敏感性区间</strong>（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 取 0.2/0.4/0.6 三档的 ROI），而不是一个孤零零的数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>把案件管道建模成<strong>带时限的多阶段链</strong>，每阶段独立打时间戳，才能把「慢了」归因到具体环节。</li>\n<li>SLA 用 <strong>P90/P95 与超时率</strong>衡量，不用平均值；且必须区分「品牌方可控时间」与「平台时间」（DSA 第 16 条只要求平台「无不迟延」，时长不可控）。</li>\n<li>单位成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>ut</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{ut}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ut</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的分母是<strong>成功下架数</strong>，分子含劳动、外采、工具与<strong>误伤</strong>四项；误伤会同时抬高成本并压缩未来的投诉权限（Amazon Project Zero 的 90% 受理率 / 99% 准确率门槛）。</li>\n<li>ROI 分子中的威慑项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 是最易被夸大的参数，必须显式列出假设并给出<strong>敏感性区间</strong>；复发率是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 从猜测变成经验值的观测口。</li>\n<li>度量要<strong>从事件流聚合</strong>、成本在发生时归集、外生参数版本化——否则 SLA 与 ROI 报告会退化成不可审计的月底填表。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"打假案件管道 SLA 与成本核算：维权 ROI 度量","id":"打假案件管道-sla-与成本核算-维权-roi-度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：案件管道是一条带时限的多阶段链","id":"核心概念-案件管道是一条带时限的多阶段链"},{"level":2,"text":"分阶段 SLA 与时限预算","id":"分阶段-sla-与时限预算"},{"level":2,"text":"单位维权成本：把人力、外采与工具拆开","id":"单位维权成本-把人力-外采与工具拆开"},{"level":2,"text":"维权 ROI 与产出度量","id":"维权-roi-与产出度量"},{"level":2,"text":"数据管道：如何把度量做成可持续的产出","id":"数据管道-如何把度量做成可持续的产出"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"侵权风险监控看板与预警：指标口径、阈值与告警工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ipr-counterfeit-graymarket-control/ipr-risk-governance-loop/ipr-risk-monitoring-dashboard"},"next":{"title":"知识产权治理合规审计与闭环改进机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ipr-counterfeit-graymarket-control/ipr-risk-governance-loop/governance-audit-compliance-loop"}}